question_fine_print:
This question will resolve according to the candidate publicly announced as the nominee of the Republican Party by the Republican Party following the party's official presidential nominee selection process. As of April 2025, this is expected to occur at the [2028 Republican National Convention](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2028_Republican_National_Convention).

In the event that the Republican Party does not select a nominee for President of the United States before election day in 2028, this question and all sub-questions shall be annulled.&#x20;

This question will also be annulled in the event that no election for the office of President of the United States is held in 2028.
